  "body": "Step into effortless coastal living with this brand-new, move-in-ready property in the heart of the Hibiscus Coast!\r\n\r\nDesigned with modern families and first-home buyers in mind, this stunning three-story home perfectly balances style, space, and convenience:\r\n\r\nSpacious Three-Level Layout: Features 3 bedrooms, 2 bathrooms, an internal-access garage plus an extra dedicated parking space, and a private terrace ideal for relaxing or outdoor dining.\r\n\r\nResort-Style Amenities On-Site: Enjoy exclusive access to a multi-purpose sports court, children's playground, and a tranquil olive walkway right at your doorstep.\r\n\r\nUnbeatable Location: Minutes from pristine local beaches, vibrant shopping hubs, top school zones, and public transport links.\r\n\r\nLow Maintenance, High Peace of Mind: Built for easy upkeep so you can spend less time on chores and more quality time with family in your peaceful sanctuary.\r\n\r\nOpportunities like this don't last-contact us today to book your private viewing!",
